	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `pw` followed by a domain (github.com) to list its accounts: ↵ copies the password, ⌘↵ the username. Type `pwgen` to generate a strong password, or `pwgen &lt;domain&gt; &lt;username&gt;` to also save it.

Passwords are copied straight to the clipboard, marked concealed so clipboard histories skip them; they never go through Alfred.

Requires apw (https://github.com/bendews/apw): `brew install bendews/homebrew-tap/apw`, `brew services start apw`, then `pw pin` to pair it after each restart.</string>
